    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="e3cac077-a27e-5cf3-8c3a-5892453b1a5a" activityNameId="6aea36da-378c-5416-a764-f2a191dc68bf" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Photovoltaic laminate, pc-Si, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Photovoltaic laminate, pc-Si, at plant
Production of solar panels with 72 solar cells a 125*125cm2 with a capacity of 166Wp. Production of 18000 panels per year.;
UUID: be3e890d-be29-3e7f-bc20-2fc6a7be8ab4
Production of the cell matrix, cutting of foils and washing of glass, production of laminate, isolation.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Modern production plant.
Time period: Date of publication.
Production volume: Worldwide module production in 2000, 238MW (60%pc-Si, 40% mc-Si). Europe 23MW.
Sampling: Environmental reports and publication of plant data. 
Extrapolations: Assumption for laminate production with data for panels. Materials for frames neglected. Number of cells 112.5 because of smaller size of cells.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_be3e890d-be29-3e7f-bc20-2fc6a7be8ab4.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
